  "threat": "An intruder breached the perimeter at the Spillway Hoist House by cutting a section of the fence and tailgating the secured door (Door P-6), gaining access to the gate PLC cabinet (PLC-2). The intruder manipulated the PLC-2 control logic, triggering a false gate opening command that was transmitted through SCADA to the Spillway Gate 4 hoist motor. This resulted in an uncommanded gate movement, violating the O&M Manual's gate operating sequence and safety thresholds. The event compromised both physical security and control system integrity, potentially disrupting dam operations and public safety.",
